    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what are you talking about with the goblin stuff? I just need to know the actual technical causes so I can tell the maintenance guy what to check. Can you stick to the HVAC stuff? What about the ductwork or the vents?",
      "source": "evaluator"
